WEBVTT

00:01.396 --> 00:02.672
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:02.741 --> 00:04.362
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:04.431 --> 00:05.844
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:05.913 --> 00:07.810
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:07.879 --> 00:10.844
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:10.913 --> 00:12.948
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.017 --> 00:14.948
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:15.017 --> 00:16.844
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:16.913 --> 00:18.534
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:18.603 --> 00:20.982
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:21.051 --> 00:22.948
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:23.017 --> 00:24.913
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:24.982 --> 00:26.948
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:27.017 --> 00:28.810
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:28.879 --> 00:30.948
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:31.017 --> 00:33.051
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:33.120 --> 00:34.396
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:34.465 --> 00:36.258
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:36.327 --> 00:38.982
[laughing]
[笑]

00:39.051 --> 00:41.293
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:41.362 --> 00:42.810
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:46.500 --> 00:49.431
[funky music, siren wailing]
[时髦的音乐，警报声]

00:49.500 --> 00:55.327
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:55.637 --> 00:56.810
- Stop, thief!
- 住手，小偷！

00:56.879 --> 00:59.672
Come back here with me formula!
带着我的配方回来吧！

00:59.741 --> 01:02.500
[yelping]
[尖叫]

01:02.568 --> 01:06.120
He's over there--stop him!
- [panting]
他就在那儿——拦住他！
- [气喘吁吁]

01:06.189 --> 01:08.362
- [laughs]
I can't help it.
- [笑]
我无能为力。

01:08.431 --> 01:10.017
I'm a kleptomaniac!
我是一个盗窃狂！

01:10.086 --> 01:12.396
- Arr!
- 啊！

01:12.465 --> 01:14.362
[both chomping]
[都在咀嚼]

01:14.431 --> 01:18.741
- [laughs]
Ow!
- [笑]
噢！

01:18.810 --> 01:19.741
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:19.810 --> 01:22.603
- You're under arrest!
- 你被捕了！

01:22.672 --> 01:23.913
- But I'm innocent!
- 但我是无辜的！

01:23.982 --> 01:26.637
- No one is innocent!
- 没有人是无辜的！

01:26.706 --> 01:27.706
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

01:27.775 --> 01:29.706
Whoa. Things got dark fast.
哇哦。事情很快就黑了。

01:29.775 --> 01:31.362
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

01:31.431 --> 01:33.500
♪ You're going to jail ♪
♪ 你会进监狱的 ♪

01:33.568 --> 01:35.189
♪ You're going to jail ♪
♪ 你会进监狱的 ♪

01:35.258 --> 01:38.396
Join in the dancing, boy,
or you're fired.
加入跳舞吧，男孩，
或者你被解雇了。

01:38.465 --> 01:40.017
♪ You're going to jail ♪
♪ 你会进监狱的 ♪

01:40.086 --> 01:41.431
♪ You're going
to jail ♪
♪ 你要走了
进监狱♪

01:41.500 --> 01:43.120
♪ You're going to jail ♪
♪ 你会进监狱的 ♪

01:43.189 --> 01:45.362
♪ You're going to jail ♪
- Step back, buddy.
♪ 你会进监狱的 ♪
-退后一步，伙计。

01:45.431 --> 01:47.293
Let the law handle this.
让法律来处理这件事吧。

01:47.362 --> 01:50.120
- Mm. Yes, officer.
- 毫米。是的，军官。

01:50.189 --> 01:53.258
- Huh!
- And I'll be taking this!
- 哈！
- 我会接受这个！

01:53.327 --> 01:55.672
- Wait!
That's me secret formula!
- 等待！
这就是我的秘密配方！

01:55.741 --> 01:58.120
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

01:58.189 --> 02:00.293
- Well, now it's evidence.
- 好吧，现在有证据了。

02:00.362 --> 02:03.741
- [straining]
- [紧张]

02:03.810 --> 02:04.741
- Oh.
- 哦。

02:04.810 --> 02:06.362
- Ow!
- 噢！

02:06.431 --> 02:07.396
- The formula!
- 公式！

02:07.465 --> 02:10.051
I can't cook without that
formula!
没有那个我就不会做饭
公式！

02:10.120 --> 02:12.672
[breathing heavily]
[呼吸粗重]

02:12.741 --> 02:14.775
I can't do anything without it!
没有它我什么也做不了！

02:14.844 --> 02:15.948
The krabby patties are gonna
taste like
蟹肉饼会
味道像

02:16.017 --> 02:18.396
ch-ch-ch-ch-ch-ch-ch--
ch-ch-ch-ch-ch-ch-ch--
ch-ch-ch-ch-ch-ch-ch--
ch-ch-ch-ch-ch-ch-ch--

02:18.465 --> 02:19.948
chum!
密友！

02:20.017 --> 02:24.810
[all grumbling]
[大家都在抱怨]

02:24.879 --> 02:26.844
- Wait! Don't go!
- 等待！别走！

02:26.913 --> 02:28.913
We still have fresh buns.
我们还有新鲜的面包。

02:30.051 --> 02:32.500
And we have air conditioning.
我们有空调。

02:32.568 --> 02:33.500
Ohh.
哦。

02:33.568 --> 02:35.086
Come here.
过来吧。

02:35.155 --> 02:37.086
You and me are getting into
that police department
你和我正在进入
那个警察局

02:37.155 --> 02:38.672
to get that formula back.
得到那个公式。

02:38.741 --> 02:39.706
- How?
- 如何？

02:39.775 --> 02:41.431
Ahh!
啊！

02:41.500 --> 02:44.534
[funky music]
[时髦音乐]

02:44.603 --> 02:45.948
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:46.017 --> 02:48.672
- By dressing like the po-po.
- 穿得像婆婆一样。

02:48.741 --> 02:50.706
- The po-po?
Oh, no, no.
- 婆婆？
哦，不，不。

02:50.775 --> 02:53.775
- No no po-po--
no job-o for you-o.
- 不，不，噗噗——
没有工作给你-o。

02:53.844 --> 02:55.534
Comprendo?
理解吗？

02:55.603 --> 02:56.948
- So so.
- 如此。

02:57.017 --> 02:58.534
[gulps]
[吞咽]

02:58.603 --> 02:59.913
But I'll go go.
但我还是去吧。

03:01.293 --> 03:03.844
- Turn to your left.
- 向左转。

03:03.913 --> 03:05.431
[camera shutter clicks]
[相机快门声]

03:06.500 --> 03:07.431
- What is this?
- 这是什么？

03:07.500 --> 03:08.948
- Mug shot.
- 脸部照片。

03:09.017 --> 03:11.155
- [scoffs]
Looks nothing like me.
- [嘲笑]
看起来一点都不像我。

03:11.224 --> 03:13.913
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

03:15.948 --> 03:17.327
[slams]
[猛击]

03:17.396 --> 03:19.086
- Low life.
- You'd live a low life too,
- 生命低下。
- 你也会过着低贱的生活

03:19.155 --> 03:21.224
officer, if you were my height!
警官，如果你像我一样高就好了！

03:21.293 --> 03:22.465
[sighs]
[叹气]

03:24.258 --> 03:25.431
[grunts]
[咕哝]

03:25.500 --> 03:26.465
[grumbles]
[抱怨]

03:26.534 --> 03:27.775
Hm?
嗯？

03:27.844 --> 03:30.706
Could have given me
a bigger blanket!
可以给我
更大的毯子！

03:30.775 --> 03:32.810
- Hm.
[soft music plays]
- 嗯。
[轻柔的音乐响起]

03:32.879 --> 03:36.189
[hums]
- [laughs]
[哼哼]
- [笑]

03:38.327 --> 03:39.672
[grunts]
[咕哝]

03:39.741 --> 03:43.431
- One too many Goofy Goobers
again, eh, Patrick?
- 太多傻瓜了
再说一次，呃，帕特里克？

03:43.500 --> 03:46.155
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

03:46.224 --> 03:51.706
No, sir, I couldn't eat
another.
不，先生，我不能吃饭
另一个。

03:51.775 --> 03:55.948
[unsteady moans]
[不稳定的呻吟声]

03:57.568 --> 04:00.637
- Get in there
and sleep it off.
- 进去
然后睡一觉。

04:00.706 --> 04:03.568
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

04:03.637 --> 04:04.637
[sighs]
[叹气]

04:06.362 --> 04:08.672
[chuckles]
[笑声]

04:10.913 --> 04:12.431
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

04:12.500 --> 04:16.017
- [snores]
- [打鼾]

04:18.155 --> 04:21.534
- Not exactly the blanket
I wanted.
- 不完全是毯子
我想要。

04:23.293 --> 04:26.224
- Isn't it a crime to
impersonate a police officer?
- 这不是犯罪吗
冒充警察？

04:26.293 --> 04:28.431
- We're not impersonating,
boy-o.
- 我们不是冒充，
男孩-o。

04:28.500 --> 04:32.913
I was in the navy, and the navy
is sort of like the cops...
我曾在海军服役，海军
有点像警察...

04:32.982 --> 04:34.637
of the sea.
海的。

04:34.706 --> 04:37.086
And I just deputized you.
我刚刚代理了你。

04:37.155 --> 04:38.534
- Deput--wow!
- 副手--哇！

04:38.603 --> 04:40.982
I always wanted to be an
officer of the law.
我一直想成为一个
法律官员。

04:41.051 --> 04:42.844
Check it out.
I'm the fuzz.
一探究竟。
我就是毛毛

04:42.913 --> 04:44.051
Ooh, look at this!
哦，看看这个！

04:44.120 --> 04:46.568
I'm also a flat foot!
[giggles]
我也是扁平足！
[咯咯笑]

04:46.637 --> 04:48.534
Watch me work.
看我工作。

04:48.603 --> 04:50.534
[whistle chirps]
[口哨声]

04:50.603 --> 04:53.672
Mr. Mime, you have the right
to remain silent.
米米先生，你有权利
保持沉默。

04:53.741 --> 04:56.396
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

04:56.465 --> 05:00.568
Stop or I'll shoot...
you a nasty look.
停下来不然我就开枪了...
你这副难看的样子。

05:00.637 --> 05:03.327
[raspberries]
[覆盆子]

05:03.396 --> 05:04.913
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

05:04.982 --> 05:07.948
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

05:08.017 --> 05:09.120
Huh?
啊？

05:09.189 --> 05:10.327
Hey, let go.
嘿，放开吧。

05:10.396 --> 05:12.258
Cops don't hold hands.
警察不拉手。

05:12.327 --> 05:15.431
- Well...they should.
- 嗯...他们应该。

05:15.500 --> 05:16.500
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

05:16.568 --> 05:19.431
- Bring it in,
Officer Little Buddy.
- 把它带进来，
警官小伙伴。

05:19.500 --> 05:20.775
- Ah!
- 啊！

05:20.844 --> 05:22.568
[both groaning]
[两人都呻吟]

05:22.637 --> 05:23.775
[all gasping]
[全都喘气]

05:23.844 --> 05:26.017
- What? Cops can hug.
- 什么？警察可以拥抱。

05:26.086 --> 05:27.465
You know, boy-o,
你知道，男孩，

05:27.534 --> 05:30.362
we probably make some pretty
good cops.
我们可能会做一些漂亮的
好警察。

05:30.431 --> 05:31.327
- Hm?
- 嗯？

05:31.396 --> 05:35.706
Ohh. What have we got here?
哦。我们这里有什么？

05:35.775 --> 05:37.189
Excuse me, miss.
对不起，小姐。

05:37.258 --> 05:39.879
Have you got a license to sell
these cookies?
你有销售许可证吗
这些饼干？

05:39.948 --> 05:41.224
- Officer SquarePants,
- 方裤警官，

05:41.293 --> 05:42.500
I don't think we ought to--
我认为我们不应该——

05:42.568 --> 05:44.500
- Let me handle this,
Officer Mr. Krabs!
- 让我来处理这件事
蟹老板先生！

05:44.568 --> 05:46.189
Well, missy,
嗯，小姐，

05:46.258 --> 05:49.775
do ya?
- I don't have a license.
是吗？
- 我没有执照。

05:49.844 --> 05:51.258
- Yeah, that's what I thought.
- 是的，我就是这么想的。

05:51.327 --> 05:53.465
You're under arrest for
violating penal code
你因以下原因被捕
违反刑法

05:53.534 --> 05:58.810
4968973025-D.
4968973025-D。
4968973025-D。
4968973025-D。

05:58.879 --> 06:00.775
- How did you know that?
- 你怎么知道的？

06:00.844 --> 06:02.362
- That's classified.
- 这是机密。

06:03.948 --> 06:05.913
- Oh, I love it here.
- 哦，我喜欢这里。

06:05.982 --> 06:08.431
We have showers, uh,
a courtyard,
我们有淋浴，呃，
一个庭院，

06:08.500 --> 06:11.982
and three square meals a day.
和一日三餐。

06:12.051 --> 06:14.258
All chum... Ahh.
都是好朋友...啊。

06:14.327 --> 06:17.327
- I know.
They're my only customer.
- 我知道。
他们是我唯一的顾客。

06:17.396 --> 06:20.500
- [laughs]
This is the best part!
- [笑]
这是最好的部分！

06:20.568 --> 06:23.017
[laughing]
[笑]

06:23.086 --> 06:24.603
Pretty cool, huh?
很酷吧？

06:24.672 --> 06:27.741
- If you attempt to use that
in front of me,
- 如果您尝试使用它
在我面前，

06:27.810 --> 06:29.396
I'll annihilate you.
我会消灭你。

06:32.293 --> 06:35.189
- Central booking,
also known as the cop shop.
- 中央预订，
也称为警察商店。

06:35.258 --> 06:37.327
- How do you know these words?
- 你怎么知道这些词的？

06:37.396 --> 06:39.465
- Still classified.
- 仍属于机密。

06:39.534 --> 06:42.706
- Well, if it isn't little
Helen the Felon.
- 好吧，如果不是少的话
重罪犯海伦。

06:42.775 --> 06:44.706
[slurps]
Good work, boys.
[啜饮]
干得好，孩子们。

06:44.775 --> 06:47.568
You nabbed the most notorious
criminal in Bikini Bottom.
你抓到了最臭名昭著的人
比基尼泳裤中的罪犯。

06:47.637 --> 06:49.500
- Huh? This sweet little thing?
- 啊？这个可爱的小东西？

06:49.568 --> 06:51.741
- You can drop the act now,
Helen.
- 你现在可以放弃表演了
海伦.

06:51.810 --> 06:54.017
- Ah!
- [yelps]
- 啊！
- [尖叫声]

06:54.086 --> 06:55.086
- Yow!
- 哟！

06:55.155 --> 06:57.189
Hey!
- [chuckles]
嘿！
- [轻笑]

06:57.258 --> 06:58.706
That's my girl.
那是我的女孩。

06:58.775 --> 07:01.982
All right, take her to the
interrogation room.
好吧，带她去
审讯室。

07:02.051 --> 07:04.120
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:04.189 --> 07:05.672
- While I look for the formula,
- 当我寻找公式时，

07:05.741 --> 07:07.637
you can interrogate
the suspect.
你可以询问
嫌疑人。

07:07.706 --> 07:09.465
- But I don't know
how to interrogate.
- 但我不知道
如何讯问。

07:09.534 --> 07:12.051
- Then just ask questions.
- 然后就问问题。

07:12.120 --> 07:14.017
And act tough.
并且表现得强硬。

07:14.086 --> 07:17.568
- Um...questions and act
tough. Got it.
- 嗯...提出问题并采取行动
艰难。知道了。

07:17.637 --> 07:20.224
Hmm...
唔...

07:20.293 --> 07:22.293
Okay, little Helen!
好吧，小海伦！

07:22.362 --> 07:25.362
[inhales deeply]
[深吸一口气]

07:25.431 --> 07:28.844
What do you think
of this weather?
你觉得怎么样
这种天气？

07:28.913 --> 07:31.879
- I think it's wuh-vely!
- 我觉得这太棒了！

07:31.948 --> 07:35.086
Let me ask you something.
让我问你一件事。

07:35.155 --> 07:37.672
How long have
you been an idiot?
有多久了
你是个白痴吗？

07:37.741 --> 07:39.810
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

07:39.879 --> 07:40.879
[stutters]
[结巴]

07:40.948 --> 07:41.948
I want a lawyer.
我想要一名律师。

07:42.017 --> 07:45.672
- Just answer the question.
- 只需回答问题即可。

07:45.741 --> 07:47.844
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

07:47.913 --> 07:48.879
[gulps]
[吞咽]

07:48.948 --> 07:50.017
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

07:50.086 --> 07:51.258
An idiot?
白痴？

07:51.327 --> 07:52.293
I don't know!
我不知道！

07:52.362 --> 07:54.155
Is it hot in here?
这里热吗？

07:54.224 --> 07:57.086
Pressure--I can't--okay,
I'll confess!
压力——我不能——好吧，
我就坦白吧！

07:57.155 --> 07:58.396
I'll confess to it all!
我会承认这一切！

07:58.465 --> 08:01.189
Anything! Whatever you got.
任何事物！无论你得到什么。

08:02.775 --> 08:04.534
- [grunting]
[metal grinding]
- [咕哝]
[金属研磨]

08:04.603 --> 08:06.017
- [sighs]
- That's it.
- [叹气]
- 就是这样。

08:06.086 --> 08:07.534
Keep up that cacophony.
继续这种刺耳的声音。

08:07.603 --> 08:10.189
Your noise is drowning out
my filing.
你的噪音被淹没
我的档案。

08:10.258 --> 08:11.431
[chuckles]
[笑声]

08:11.500 --> 08:14.017
- My stomach needs frozen
treats.
- 我的胃需要冷冻
款待。

08:14.086 --> 08:16.086
Frozen treats.
冷冻食品。

08:16.155 --> 08:17.741
Huh.
呵呵。

08:17.810 --> 08:21.741
I'm gonna have to make myself
some jailhouse ice cream.
我得让自己
一些监狱冰淇淋。

08:21.810 --> 08:25.224
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

08:25.293 --> 08:26.224
Hmm.
唔。

08:26.293 --> 08:28.568
Oh.
[grunts]
哦。
[咕哝]

08:28.637 --> 08:31.637
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

08:34.431 --> 08:38.913
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:38.982 --> 08:41.637
Ah. [sighs]
啊。 [叹气]

08:46.189 --> 08:48.017
[heavenly tones]
[天籁之音]

08:48.086 --> 08:49.120
[sighs]
[叹气]

08:49.189 --> 08:50.568
[metal grinding]
Try it!
[金属研磨]
试试吧！

08:50.637 --> 08:52.086
You can't even tell the
difference.
你甚至无法告诉
差异。

08:52.155 --> 08:53.844
- Blech!
- 布莱奇！

08:53.913 --> 08:55.672
No, thanks.
不，谢谢。

08:55.741 --> 08:58.293
But, say,
I know where they keep
但是，说吧，
我知道他们藏在哪里

08:58.362 --> 09:01.465
the real ice cream
around here:
真正的冰淇淋
这里附近：

09:01.534 --> 09:03.534
in the evidence room.
在证物室里。

09:03.603 --> 09:06.189
A guy like you who knows
his way around here
像你这样懂事的人
他在这里的路

09:06.258 --> 09:08.258
might be able--
- I have a key.
或许能够——
- 我有钥匙。

09:08.327 --> 09:09.672
- Oh, really?
- 哦真的吗？

09:09.741 --> 09:10.810
Let's go!
我们走吧！

09:10.879 --> 09:12.293
- [gulps]
- [吞咽]

09:12.362 --> 09:14.672
[hums]
[哼哼]

09:14.741 --> 09:16.775
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:18.155 --> 09:21.189
[funky music]
[时髦音乐]

09:21.258 --> 09:22.293
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:22.362 --> 09:23.327
- Donuts?
- 甜甜圈？

09:23.396 --> 09:25.672
Whoa!
哇！

09:26.982 --> 09:28.913
Hm.
Well...
嗯。
出色地...

09:28.982 --> 09:30.775
Maybe just one.
也许只有一个。

09:30.844 --> 09:32.982
[chomps]
[咀嚼]

09:33.051 --> 09:34.258
[spits]
[吐口水]

09:34.327 --> 09:36.017
Evidence room!
物证室！

09:36.086 --> 09:38.120
- [moans]
- Huh?
- [呻吟]
- 啊？

09:38.189 --> 09:40.741
You promised me ice cream!
你答应过我吃冰淇淋的！

09:40.810 --> 09:42.327
Hmph!
哼！

09:42.396 --> 09:45.362
- Look, once I get the secret
formula and rule the world,
- 听着，一旦我知道了秘密
公式并统治世界，

09:45.431 --> 09:47.224
I'll buy you all the ice cream
you want!
我给你买所有的冰淇淋
你想要！

09:47.293 --> 09:48.775
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:48.844 --> 09:52.327
Let's see. Comic books,
sea shells...
让我们来看看。漫画书，
海贝壳...

09:52.396 --> 09:54.086
an old man...
一个老人...

09:54.155 --> 09:55.086
- Hello!
- 你好！

09:55.155 --> 09:56.155
- Outboard motors...
- 舷外发动机...

09:56.224 --> 09:57.637
stolen jokes...
偷来的笑话...

09:57.706 --> 09:59.672
a leg...
- My leg!
一条腿...
- 我的腿！

09:59.741 --> 10:00.810
- Hmm?
- 唔？

10:00.879 --> 10:04.396
Well, drop a dime on me!
There it is!
好吧，给我一毛钱吧！
就在那里！

10:04.465 --> 10:05.431
[heavenly tones]
[chuckles]
[天籁之音]
[笑声]

10:05.500 --> 10:07.086
- Oh, no, you don't.
- 哦，不，你不知道。

10:07.155 --> 10:09.396
- Krabs?
What are you doing here?
- 螃蟹？
你在这里做什么？

10:09.465 --> 10:12.568
I stole that formula
fair and square!
我偷了那个公式
公平公正！

10:12.637 --> 10:15.396
- Well, I'm stealing it back.
- 好吧，我把它偷回来了。

10:15.465 --> 10:17.603
- Oh, no, you're not!
- 哦，不，你不是！

10:17.672 --> 10:19.672
- [yelps]
- [尖叫声]

10:19.741 --> 10:20.879
Ooh...ooh!
噢……噢！

10:20.948 --> 10:22.120
[boxes clatter]
[箱子碰撞声]

10:22.189 --> 10:24.017
- Hello!
- 你好！

10:24.086 --> 10:25.155
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

10:25.224 --> 10:26.810
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

10:26.879 --> 10:28.775
- Hello!
- 你好！

10:28.844 --> 10:30.948
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

10:31.017 --> 10:31.948
- [yelps]
- [尖叫声]

10:32.017 --> 10:33.189
[clattering]
[咔哒声]

10:33.258 --> 10:34.603
all: Hello!
全体：您好！

10:34.672 --> 10:38.948
- Who's been pinching
all these geezers?
- 谁捏了
所有这些家伙？

10:39.017 --> 10:40.224
- Where's my ice cream?
- 我的冰淇淋呢？

10:40.293 --> 10:41.844
Where's my ice cream?
我的冰淇淋在哪里？

10:41.913 --> 10:43.913
Where--
[gasps]
哪里——
[喘气]

10:43.982 --> 10:45.293
Ohh.
哦。

10:45.362 --> 10:47.293
Well, there it is.
嗯，就是这样。

10:47.362 --> 10:49.534
- [groans]
- [panting]
- [呻吟]
- [气喘吁吁]

10:49.603 --> 10:51.913
- What are you doing,
you maniac?
- 你在做什么，
你疯子？

10:51.982 --> 10:53.741
Help! Police!
帮助！警察！

10:53.810 --> 10:55.258
[yelping]
[尖叫]

10:55.327 --> 10:56.500
- [yells]
- [大喊]

10:56.568 --> 10:58.086
- What do you think you're--
- 你认为你是什么——

10:58.155 --> 10:59.568
[all yelling]
[大家大喊]

10:59.637 --> 11:01.500
- I don't know
what you two are doing,
- 我不知道
你们两个在做什么

11:01.568 --> 11:03.465
but it looks illegal.
但这看起来是非法的。

11:03.534 --> 11:04.706
[all yelling]
[大家大喊]

11:04.775 --> 11:05.568
- [yells]
- [大喊]

11:05.637 --> 11:08.603
I have a confession to make!
我有一个事要坦白！

11:10.120 --> 11:12.913
- I'll just hold onto this
formula till the morning.
- 我会抓住这个
配方直到早上。

11:12.982 --> 11:14.948
- Oh, but, officer,
I have more confessions.
- 哦，但是，警官，
我还有更多的忏悔。

11:15.017 --> 11:16.362
- Zip it, kid.
- 拉上拉链，孩子。

11:16.431 --> 11:18.672
I get it.
You're a criminal mastermind.
我得到它。
你是一个犯罪主谋。

11:18.741 --> 11:19.706
- Guilty.
- 有罪的。

11:19.775 --> 11:20.568
Yay!
耶！

11:20.637 --> 11:22.879
- Hey, where's Patrick?
- 嘿，帕特里克在哪儿？

11:22.948 --> 11:23.948
- [wails]
- [哀号]

11:24.017 --> 11:26.396
[key clangs]
[按键叮当声]

11:26.465 --> 11:29.431
[unsteady laughter]
[不稳定的笑声]

11:31.465 --> 11:33.189
[sighing]
[叹气]

11:33.258 --> 11:34.637
Oh.
哦。

11:34.706 --> 11:35.879
[sighing]
[叹气]

11:35.948 --> 11:38.120
[all yelp,
Patrick snores]
[大家尖叫，
帕特里克打鼾]

11:38.189 --> 11:41.327
- Well, I must confess
this is sure cozy.
- 好吧，我必须承认
这确实很舒服。

- 好吧，我必须承认
这确实很舒服。